{"name": "HYPERWIRED", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2D pixel art roguelike space shooter with plugged resource management, procedural levels and challenging bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hold the controls tight and do not get stranded in the void! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/f68a66fa2aca4c1fbad89c85a0e8e0b0.webp?t=1782987970\" width=\"454\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/fd39236de4fd2305a07ae149dbc1ed2d.poster.avif?t=1782987970\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/fd39236de4fd2305a07ae149dbc1ed2d.webm?t=1782987970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/fd39236de4fd2305a07ae149dbc1ed2d.mp4?t=1782987970\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plug in to recharge your energy and manage your resources.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be Careful! Once plugged, you'll only be able to move within the range of your cable!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space is plunged into darkness, activate the spacesockets to clear a level and travel to the next sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/010a023bbb9a953d74b14f9b00a5d411.webp?t=1782987970\" width=\"232\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/621d74591834d0221ec25510225abf7e.poster.avif?t=1782987970\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/621d74591834d0221ec25510225abf7e.webm?t=1782987970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/621d74591834d0221ec25510225abf7e.mp4?t=1782987970\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between <strong>10+\u00a0different ships </strong>with<strong> different gameplay modes!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your <strong>mega-laser!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form an <strong>army </strong>of rescued <strong>stranded ships</strong> that will fight alongside you!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Destroy </strong>the stages and defeat a large variety of enemies!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter dangerous and challenging <strong>BOSSES </strong>after each galaxy in your quest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/a7960c03bd088a760804db5121f1dee9.webp?t=1782987970\" width=\"478\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/17a3dca76c9623829ba99350e52c8019.poster.avif?t=1782987970\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/17a3dca76c9623829ba99350e52c8019.webm?t=1782987970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/17a3dca76c9623829ba99350e52c8019.mp4?t=1782987970\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Holding the breach, dodging enemy bullets, and piloting through narrow hallways shouldn't be a problem, BUT just in case... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ship is equipped with a futuristic <strong>Slow-Mo System</strong> that you can use <strong>almost whenever you want!</strong> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Luckily for you, it<strong> recharges by collecting energy from dead enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/extras/b7a391ab83193921044da5d2c3190b0d.webp?t=1782987970\" width=\"298\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up <strong>BATTERIES </strong>and discover <strong>+250 combinations</strong> of bullet modifiers!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get <strong>CHIPS </strong>of temporary upgrades by destroying enemies!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between <strong>more than 40 upgrades for your ship.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize charge times, improve your firepower, get more cable length...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become <strong>invisible </strong>to enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more!</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Hyperwired is a classic top-down action shooter, where your spaceship has a plug hanging from it. Wire yourself into sockets, gather upgrades, and unlock ships as you explore a procedurally generated galaxy with roguelike elements.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234850/f94cc392a251d3da2701671e7763d034c9528f08/header.jpg?t=1782987970", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Hell", "Action Roguelike", "Roguelite", "Shoot 'Em Up", "Difficult", "Arcade"], "developers": "SIDRALGAMES", "publishers": "SIDRALGAMES", "release_date": "Jul 2, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "3234850", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "2 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/UWG2k6KlfSA", "first_seen": 1782943200.0, "review_rank": 354}